<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<jcr:root xmlns:jcr="http://www.jcp.org/jcr/1.0" xmlns:nt="http://www.jcp.org/jcr/nt/1.0" xmlns:sling="http://sling.apache.org/jcr/sling/1.0"
    jcr:primaryType="sling:Folder"
    sling:resourceType="sling-matrix/pages/page">
    <jcr:content
        jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
        jcr:title="Observability"
        sling:resourceType="sling-matrix/pages/contentpage">
        <main
            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
            sling:resourceType="sling-matrix/components/parsys"
            allowedComponents="[code-block,feature-image,slide-headline,text-block]">
            <slide-headline-1
                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                sling:resourceType="sling-matrix/components/slide-headline"
                headline="Logs, Metrics, Traces"/>
            <text-block-1
                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                sling:resourceType="sling-matrix/components/text-block"
                text="&lt;p>Sling logs through Logback, configurable per-bundle from the Felix Web Console or via &lt;code>org.apache.sling.commons.log&lt;/code> configurations. OSGi components can additionally expose &lt;strong>JMX MBeans&lt;/strong> for runtime state, and a Prometheus exporter can scrape those into time-series metrics for dashboards and alerting.&lt;/p>"/>
            <slide-headline-2
                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                sling:resourceType="sling-matrix/components/slide-headline"
                headline="Alerting on What Matters"/>
            <text-block-2
                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                sling:resourceType="sling-matrix/components/text-block"
                text="&lt;p>Good dashboards track request latency and error rate at the HTTP layer, JVM health (heap, GC pauses, thread count), and repository-level indicators (Oak cache hit rate, revision GC lag). Alert on trends and thresholds that predict user-visible pain, not on every noisy log line.&lt;/p>"/>
        </main>
    </jcr:content>
</jcr:root>
